<title>UK: Brit. Borneo says high bidder on USG blocks.</title>
<headline>Brit. Borneo says high bidder on USG blocks.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>British-Borneo Petroleum Syndicate Plc said on Thursday its units were the high bidders on 33 out of 57 Gulf of Mexico blocks applied for at a U.S. government lease sale.</p>
<p>The company said it would pay total lease bonuses of $22 million for the offshore Louisiana interests.</p>
</text>
